| Path | Kind | What changes |
|---|---|---|
| `apps/web/src/together/FriendRows.tsx` | change | `RequestRow`: add `asking` state, `questionId`, and the inline question in place of the incoming actions |
| `apps/web/src/i18n/zh-CN.json` | change | one new entry for the new question sentence |
