- `FriendRow` (its code, its wording and its question)
- `apps/web/src/together/TogetherRoute.tsx` (its `onBlock` wiring at lines 287-289 stays)
- `apps/web/src/together/FriendsButton.tsx` and its test (the panel passes no `onBlock`, so it shows no Block)
- `apps/web/src/together/testids.ts`
- `e2e/` (no spec uses `TOGETHER_REQUEST_BLOCK`)
